// This is a file operation rather than a code conversion
// The task is to move project-logo.png from the root directory to src/assets/images/project-logo.png

// In Angular CLI, we would use:
// 1. Create the directory if it doesn't exist:
//    mkdir -p src/assets/images
// 2. Copy the file:
//    cp project-logo.png src/assets/images/project-logo.png

// No TypeScript code is needed for this operation as it's a file move/copy
// The image will be referenced in Angular components using:
// <img src="assets/images/project-logo.png" alt="Project Logo">